  - <ID>k__BackingField: 863d73b7-f88e-4b33-8647-9e65c160bae8
    <Name>k__BackingField: 45
    <Text>k__BackingField: Yo, shh. Keep your voice down.
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: "It\u2019s absolutely destroying the natural wave
