  - <ID>k__BackingField: 9eee130a-d343-4db5-ab06-562bbbc40c5c
    <Name>k__BackingField: 11
    <Text>k__BackingField: "[wave] I\u2019m just a boy, standing in front of a jacuzzi,
      asking it to be a desert dune so I can brood properly."
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
