  - <ID>k__BackingField: 7a2c8067-0b50-4f00-8a56-6bdaccd0ea49
    <Name>k__BackingField: 8
    <Text>k__BackingField: I chose this Venetian mask because it represents the duality
      of the human condition.
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 4d28e466-2333-47a9-8363-f75418617fb2
