  - <ID>k__BackingField: 4d28e466-2333-47a9-8363-f75418617fb2
    <Name>k__BackingField: 9
    <Text>k__BackingField: We are all just actors on a stage that is slowly burning
      down.
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 5d4b3f31-b646-4ebf-839f-f066cadd87d8
