  - <ID>k__BackingField: 5d4b3f31-b646-4ebf-839f-f066cadd87d8
    <Name>k__BackingField: 10
    <Text>k__BackingField: Also, the white porcelain really highlights my cheekbones.
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 9eee130a-d343-4db5-ab06-562bbbc40c5c
