  - <ID>k__BackingField: d38a1275-e6af-430e-b87f-00824c17ecfb
    <Name>k__BackingField: 12
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Do you have a cigarette? I don\u2019t smoke, I just want
      to hold it melancholically."
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
