    <Name>k__BackingField: DialogueName
    <Text>k__BackingField: Or should I lean more to the left to catch the sorrowful
      lighting?
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Next DIalogue
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: c62ca95d-3903-4166-8554-13603e9f8d25
