  - <ID>k__BackingField: be699791-c44f-43f4-85f7-0d5d6ff458c1
    <Name>k__BackingField: 16
    <Text>k__BackingField: "I\u2019m not going to 'kill' him... that\u2019s such
      a crude word."
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Timothy Charlemagne
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
